      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUMBUK WANG WANG (3) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. In the money last time at Bendigo (23.82) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length third. With a clean break looks hard to beat. AUSTRAL WARRIORS (1) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (28.86) at this track in Restricted WIN over 510m. Won at his only start from this box. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. HUGO ROSE (7) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished second (29.69) at Sandown latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has a good record at this journey. Can measure up. EAGLE BREAD (8) has strong credentials from this draw.",
